Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our stories live in the things we carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are memories passed down through our\Nhands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Others are values passed from one\Ngeneration to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when we travel far, we never forget\Nour roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We carry the past so we can give something\Nto the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because our stories continue through the\Nmeaning we pass on.
